# The complete vendor root also mutates private descriptor/list state, enters
# the g_osi critical section, spins on the reload bit and maintains optional
# diagnostics/statistics. The adapter qualifies the source-owned Rust ring and
# staging transaction instead of importing those C runtime responsibilities.
function libpp wDev_AppendRxBlocks
disposition replaced-by-composition
protocol wifi
rust-component open_esp_radio_esp32s31_wifi_lmac::rx_pool::RxStagePool::stage_recycle
binding v1
rust-probe open_libpp_rx_trace_wdev_append_rx_blocks
driver-adapter esp32s31-wdev-append-rx-blocks-v1
effect-contract exact-effects-v1
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104080 replaced-by-async rx-descriptor-reload-clear attempts=0x186a1
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104080 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x20104088 required
effect mmio-read 32 0x2010408c required
effect mmio-write 32 0x20104084 required
effect state-write 32 rx-ring.old-tail-next required
effect state-write 32 rx-ring.pending-tail required
effect state-write 32 rx-ring.accepted-tail required
effect platform-call critical-section platform-provided-service embassy-rx-ring-ownership
effect platform-call debug-diagnostic allowed-omission unused-instrumentation
effect platform-provided-service embassy-rx-ring-ownership required
effect initialization-prerequisite valid-zero-terminated-rx-chain required
effect initialization-prerequisite unique-rx-descriptor-storage required
